# dpkg-buildpackage builds in the source tree, so the objects, the staging
# tree and the debhelper stamps all land here. Ignored rather than trusted
# to a careful "git add": on 2026-08-13 a "git add --all" after a package
# build swept eleven megabytes of them into a commit.
obj-*/
debian/.debhelper/
debian/onak-foopgp/
debian/files
debian/*.debhelper
debian/*.debhelper.log
debian/*.substvars
debian/debhelper-build-stamp
